{
 "text": " Now, let's go to default pricing. On this page, you can set your default pricing across the different corridors you operate in. The default pricing rules apply to all your senders, uniformly. You may add tier based pricing based on the transaction volumes. You can add as many tiers as you want, but do remember, the volume from column in the first year must always be zero, and the volume to column in the last year must always be set to 1 trillion. You can choose the date and time at which any pricing can be effective from. If you leave it blank, it will apply immediately. Once you've added the details, click on review pricing. You can see the pricing structure, additional fee details, and illustrative examples of how much you earn in each tier. Once you've reviewed it, click confirm and save to add this pricing.",
